          estrC2: "<strong>Business impact in numbers:</strong> Over a year the system automatically found 65 line items billed well below their work type's average rate — €10,287.64 combined, over 4% of annual profit, that would otherwise surface only at year-end, when it's too late to fix. With an alert, these gaps get caught while the job is still running. On top of that: fewer payroll calculation mistakes and faster month-end closing.",
